Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"median","pool":"pool1"}

Thought: Test a weighted combination on the larger pool3 to see if adding more diverse models improves over the best single.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","pool":"pool3","weights":"inverse_error"}

Thought: Test a weighted ensemble on the slightly larger pool2 to see if adding a few more models improves over the best single model.  
